"id": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-J4D9VFd6aoQ7kNvwFKH9cz&_nc_oc=AdqhggEGsbDeHpBRaiNjDAHG2uRlexTEAEazrN8o_Vii3wgckhwS2R_iA7W_cuxKsLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPGpds0NNaUnEP7swPRi55M3RGktD48GvD8sVQ-bBwF4w&oe=6ACE4C8A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nvr6dKP_FTMQ7kNvwFY9A-H&_nc_oc=Adr0hw8-7KmX3CXvvsF2OGA5cG7JDDxfhzUbDNrFDmS81L65QT4YQNlh2zdYhhJYKAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMwzOO-YfyykBgOLfrDf2whdLaKqMHR2lsJXT8t786kgA&oe=6ACE5CC4"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C4JGXuHcbkMQ7kNvwFtVVBY&_nc_oc=Adp8hWrlKvvk3q7lK4DZaNNmlkm1aosTuYhbDu4ZRKuMG7XxYUHz7mi8S05YA4Ck_Mw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOt6XwLXxwybH1CtcVEYbBtdUQQZSjbDp_UzTI5qESjfg&oe=6ACE629E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Squingle_Demo_v2_Cover_Landscape.png", "id": "964144373025532", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292232_964144376358865_8987889214839571925_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ShCWrKWgQd0Q7kNvwEf2eL1&_nc_oc=AdpEs7shTluSuDyASLRn2i0i97J3kqPNEZFBYSN7UFDlmkFyFXBME1dGVAUw9IjGN0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPctN7nP8LxjoyKi4LesuAwkq6_zCzKAsQ9ESp2xY3wAQ&oe=6ACE5F67"}, "display_name": "Squingle Demo", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle Demo, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Demo Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "Squingle Demo offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "c